OL,3,ABadenoch says she is bringing in
OL,4,Alawyers to challenge government after
OL,5,ATory-run council's 94% tax hike
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,8,Fsaid she has brought in lawyers to
OL,9,Fchallenge the government over local
OL,10,Ffunding cuts, after a record council
OL,11,Ftax rise in one of her party's flagship
OL,12,Flocal authorities.
OL,14,FShe told BBC Newsnight the proposed 94%
OL,15,Fhike in Wandsworth, a south-west London
OL,16,Fborough run by the Tories, was
OL,17,F"outrageous".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
